;352,告白する
;
;人攫いと屋台の女将、人間と二つの関係を持ち色々な意味でニンゲンが好きそうなミスティアだから、
;人間と妖怪の恋の行方もシビアに考えていそうな一方で、性格的にはそれを包み隠そうとする気がする。
;なにより、可愛らしい、美しいだけでなく、妖怪的な禍々しさも併せ持ってこそミスティアだと思う。
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K28_352
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K28_352_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K28_352_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL && !FLAG:70 
	;告白成功
	IF TFLAG:193
		PRINTFORMW 「Nfufu, I love you too♪」
		PRINTFORMW 「...Hmm?」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW As she says that, Mystia stares at you curiously.
		PRINTFORMDW In order to make sure you've properly conveyed your feelings to her, you confess your love once again.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Yes, of course. Not just as friends, but as something much more special.」
		PRINTFORMW 「As lovers... Or, to put it more bluntly...」
		;MASTERが女（女性器がある）
		IF (TALENT:MASTER:性別 & 1)
			PRINTFORMW 「As an adult relationship between two women, one that's just a wee bit naughty... That's what you mean♪」
		;MASTERが男
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「As a man and a woman, together as mates... That's what you mean♪」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 「So, am I on the mark?」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW Somehow Mystia seems to think that your relationship is even further along than you were aware of!
		PRINTFORMDW However, if she's able to overcome any anxiety and tension and accept your confession so calmly...
		PRINTFORMDW It makes you look like a bit of an idiot, for needing to summon up so much courage to express your affection.
		PRINTFORMDW It would make you feel better about it if she were more bashful or flustered, or something else dramatic like that!
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Love, or that feeling, they say... Isn't that something that you don't realize until you notice it's been there the whole time?」
		PRINTFORMW 「I love you too, so I'm happy that you realized your feelings, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
		PRINTFORMW 「That's why... I totally understand what you're trying to say.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Well... I guess also understand why you'd want the confession to be a big dramatic deal.」
		PRINTFORMW 「It's so that you can convince yourself, you know.」
		PRINTFORMW 「So, to make the moment a little more special, I'll give you a little test～」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW And then, Mystia spreads her arms and her wings wide.
		PRINTFORMDW With Mystia at the center, a vortex of spectral, eerie energy suddenly erupts and swallows you up...
		PRINTFORMDW Disoriented and terrified, you stand in the center of the ill-omened miasma...
		PRINTFORMDW The girl in front of you cloaks herself in silence, as if taunting you with her bewitching aura.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Well, come take your lover in your arms, if you dare...」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW Her ominous wings are like poisonous moths that fly through the dead of night...
		PRINTFORMDW Her talons, died coppery-brown like dried blood, seem to extend oddly far from her fingers...
		PRINTFORMDW Her iridescent eyes glitter bewitchingly, her enigmatic smile seems to sneer at you derisively...
		PRINTFORMDW Everything that used to seem so pretty is now full of menace and horror.
		PRINTFORMDW But her beauty is untarnished, she glitters sublimely in the eerie light.
		PRINTFORMDW Or perhaps that's just because you've already succumbed to her miasma.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Look, come here.」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW The night sparrow youkai beseeches you affectionately, while clad in calamity.
		PRINTFORMDW What's even more terrifying than her appearance is how each and every word she utters reverberates sweetly, charmingly through your skull...
		PRINTFORMDW And yet there's her gentle, meek smile, unlike any smile anyone has ever given you since you were born.
		PRINTFORMDW You can't see her clearly, the ever-thickening vortex of miasma is steadily obscuring your vision...
		PRINTFORMDW A desire wells up, you want to see her more clearly, touch her tender face...
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Here... This way～」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW But your knees are trembling so much that they're useless.
		PRINTFORMDW The human blood pulsing through your veins warns of life-threatening danger.
		PRINTFORMDW Your instincts scream that even her soft smile and gentle words are a trap, designed to snare and slaughter powerless humans...
		PRINTFORMDW Nevertheless, Mystia's visage still beckons to you, her bewitching beauty filling your eyes.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「...」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW Fear and adoration war in your breast, vying over the girl who has revealed her true nature as a youkai.
		PRINTFORMDW At last a victor emerges, and you resume walking towards her, the source of the unearthly affection.
		PRINTFORMDW To prove your "love" to Mystia...
		PRINTFORMDW To show her that even if she's a youkai... No, rather that you love her all the more for being a youkai.
		PRINTFORMDW You take step after step towards her, but somehow the eerie miasma seems to block you from coming any closer.
		PRINTFORMDW You don't give up, instead you just put all your strength into your legs...
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Ahh... Mnh♪」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW Along with Mystia's charming sigh, you're wrapped in her soft embrace.
		PRINTFORMDW With a start you realize that there's no distance between you at all, as if her voice awakened you from a nightmare.
		PRINTFORMDW Her gentle arms, her inviting warmth, her delicate fragrance... You can clearly sense it all.
		PRINTFORMDW You can't feel that eerie miasma anymore. That vortex that was swallowing up your body seems to be utterly gone.
		PRINTFORMDW If you're not mistaken, this must mean you've passed the fearsome youkai's test.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「...So. That was pretty dramatic, pretty unforgettable, don't you think?」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW With a squeeze, Mystia returns your hug.
		PRINTFORMDW It's just the sort of hug you'd expect of a youkai. Incredibly forceful——but not enough to hurt. It feels wonderful...
		PRINTFORMDW A sense of peace comes over you. It's an embrace that seems to feel you to your core.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Ahh, I wasn't worried.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Even if you had collapsed...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I would've just summoned you back up with the power of my song.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But naturally... %CALLNAME:MASTER%, I know you love me, no small amount.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But I also love you, too... %CALLNAME:MASTER%%UNICODE(0x2665)%」
		PRINTFORMW 「So... Not just from you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, but also from me...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I wanted to do my part, and meet you halfway...」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW Mystia smiles at you, but somehow her expression has a hint of sadness in it.
		PRINTFORMDW Looking at that smile makes you uneasy, you want to avert your eyes...
		PRINTFORMDW Solving the conundrum, you clutch her tightly to your chest.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「Aaahn... So warm... I'll squeeze you even more tooo～%UNICODE(0x2665)%」
		PRINTFORMW 「One more time... I love you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%♪」
		PRINTFORMW 「I'll never let you go... You'll always be mine♪」
		PRINT
		PRINTFORMDW You soak in Mystia's body heat, and savor her soft movements against your chest.
		PRINTFORMDW You dwell on the wonderful days that are just beginning...
	;告白失敗
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「...Yes, thank you for the complement.」
		PRINTFORMW 「However, that's why those words aren't appropriate for a monster like me.」
		PRINTFORMW 「There's a human out there somewhere, waiting for those words. you should say it to them.」
		CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"Even if you can't find \@ IS_MALE(MASTER) ? her # him\@ right now, \@ IS_MALE(MASTER) ? she # he\@'ll appear someday, and when they do they'll be waiting for that moment.", "w"
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDW It seems you've been politely turned down. Better luck next time.
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
