;==================================================
;411,戦闘訓練
;
;鳥目！　緊縛弾幕！
;あと個人的に花映塚での性能から手堅いイメージがある
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K28_411
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K28_411_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K28_411_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL && !FLAG:70 
	;はじめて
	IF FIRSTTIME(411)
		PRINTFORMW 「Combat training? You want to practice a Danmaku match?」
		PRINTFORMW 「Hm, I can't say I'm qualified to teach... But I'll give it a shot.」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMDL Mystia starts a chant similar to her singing voice...
		PRINTFORMDL Her familiar spirits zoom all around, emitting dazzling lights.
		PRINTFORMDW Her lines of Danmaku aren't aimed directly at you, instead calculated to restrict your movements.
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「The true nature of Danmaku is more than just power and brains.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Feel it on your skin... With your whole body... Fufu～」
	ELSEIF RAND:6 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Familiar spirits, status ailments, well, I'll admit that I'm relying on others...」
		PRINTFORMW 「But, isn't a Spell Card that always has room in its heart wonderful?」
		PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER% too, don't you think it'd be nice to try and learn a Spell Card which uses familiar spirits?」
	ELSEIF RAND:5 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Who gives me a hard time in Danmaku?」
		PRINTFORMW 「Whether in Danmaku or not, Youmu can easily slash my familiars with her sword, and strike them down.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But such a desperate match is the most fun♪ I'm grateful to Youmu.」
	ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「I'll just say it at this point. My Danmaku barrages don't have a great chance of scoring a direct hit.」
		PRINTFORMW 「So if someone handles them cleanly, the situation'll get worse and worse for me.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But when you're in a tight spot is when Danmaku gets fun! Don't you think so too?」
	ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
		;夜
		IF TIME:2 >= 5 && TIME:2 <= 7
			PRINTFORMW 「Sure enough, the night is best... This is going to be fun!」
			PRINTFORMW 「The feeling of slowly cornering a little child who's lost %HIS_HER(MASTER)% light, it's so thrilling♪」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Naughty children who won't sit still need to get tied up♪」
			PRINTFORMW 「Bird Sign 『Human Cage』!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Now then, why don't we enjoy ourselves? That's right, for a long, long time... Fufu～」
			;LunaticでみすちーVSみすちーをするのはNG
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF RAND:2
		;MASTERのほうが戦闘能力が高い
		IF ABL:戦闘能力 < ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMW 「Ahhn♪ That was a nice move♪」
			PRINTFORMW 「If your opponent's really strong, well then... It's best to make them a bit weaker.」
			PRINTFORMW 「So that's why I'm gonna have to tie up those constant movements of yours♪」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Can this attack be avoided? Yes, it certainly can.」
			PRINTFORMW 「So when will the attack actually connect?」
			PRINTFORMW 「You see, this is a defensive Danmaku barrage... The goal is to bind up your movements, while I recover my spiritual energy.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And at the same time, my song should be wearing down your nerves...」
		ENDIF
	ELSE
		LOCAL:1 = RAND:54 + 1
		;乱数がみすちーの場合、あなたに
		IF LOCAL:1 == 28
			PRINTFORML 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%? You're strong!」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「%CALLNAME:(LOCAL:1)%? You're strong!」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「The start, the middle, and the finish... I can't find any gaps.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But, I won't lose so easily!」
		PRINTL  
		PRINTFORMW 「My familiar spirits... I want everyone to see the Danmaku display of my lively familiar spirits!」
		;ミスティアは綿密な序盤作戦とファンt……パワフルな終盤に定評がありそう。鰻屋だし
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
